
= txt2tags-ports =

Ports of [txt2tags https://txt2tags.org], the plain-text-to-40+-formats
converter, to several languages: Python 3, Perl, Lua, Tcl, Rust and Go, on
top of the original Python script.

[images/txt2tags-ports.png]

https://github.com/luginf/txt2tags-ports

= txt2tags-it =

A script for [QOwnNotes https://www.qownnotes.org/], derived from the official
markdown-it script: it adds txt2tags syntax on top of Markdown, both in the
editor and in the preview pane.

[github.com/luginf/txt2tags-it https://github.com/luginf/txt2tags-it]
